# =========================================================================
# orch_crew_log.tcyr — a crew's durable log (2.5.0, ADR 036).
#
# What a run writes, line by line: the spec first, every event numbered with no gap whether or
# not anyone is subscribed, a finished task's result and the crew's state beside their events,
# and each tool call's intent before the call runs, ahead of a consumer's journal. And what a
# disk that refuses does: a spec that will not go down leaves no log, an intent that will not go
# down refuses its call, and an event that will not go down lets the crew go on.
#
# Stdlib is auto-prepended from cyrius.cyml — do NOT include stdlib modules.
# =========================================================================

